{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, עֲלַל","hw":"עֲלַל","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">עֲלַל</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. go</strong> or <strong>come in (</strong>𝔗 Syriac; v. BH <a data-ref=\"BDB, עָלַל⁴\" href=\"/BDB,_עָלַל⁴\", dir=\"rtl\">III. עלל</a><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Pe.</strong>  Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:16\" href=\"/Daniel.2.16\">Dn 2:16</a>; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> pers. v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:24\" href=\"/Daniel.2.24\">24</a>; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְבַיְתֵהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:11\" href=\"/Daniel.6.11\">6:11</a>, so 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">עללת</span> Kt, <span dir=\"rtl\">עַלַּת</span> Qr <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:10\" href=\"/Daniel.5.10\">5:10</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">עללין</span> Kt, <span dir=\"rtl\">עָלִּין</span> Qr, abs. <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:4\" href=\"/Daniel.4.4\">4:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:8\" href=\"/Daniel.5.8\">5:8</a>.<br><strong>Haph.</strong>  <em>bring in</em>, c. <span dir=\"rtl\">קֳדָם</span> pers.: Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַנְעֵל</span> (K<sup>§ 11, 4. b</sup>; so Egyptian Aramaic, S-C <sup>G 6, 7, 24, 27</sup> <span dir=\"rtl\">הנעלת</span>; cf. D<sup>§ 71. 7; Dial.-Proben, p. 4</sup>); <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:25\" href=\"/Daniel.2.25\">Dn 2:25</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">ל</span> acc. pers.), <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:19\" href=\"/Daniel.6.19\">6:19</a> (acc. rei); Imv. ms. sf. pers., <span dir=\"rtl\">הַעֵלְנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:24\" href=\"/Daniel.2.24\">2:24</a>; Inf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְהַנְעָלָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:3\" href=\"/Daniel.4.3\">4:3</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">ל</span> acc. pers.); no <span dir=\"rtl\">קֳדָם</span> pers., <span dir=\"rtl\">לֶהֶעָלָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:7\" href=\"/Daniel.5.7\">5:7</a> (id.).<br><strong>Hoph.</strong>  (W<sup>CG 225</sup>) <em>be brought</em>, subj. pers. + <span dir=\"rtl\">קֳדָם</span> pers.: Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">הֻעַל</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:13\" href=\"/Daniel.5.13\">Dn 5:13</a>, 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">הֻעַ֫לּוּ</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:15\" href=\"/Daniel.5.15\">15</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, מֶעָל","prev":"BDB Aramaic, עִלָּה²"}